  "duration_s": 266.771995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你们三个去老街夜市卖冰棍儿，每人一百，谁赚最多。爷爷答应他一个愿望得嘞，爷爷您瞧，好吧，必须的，咱肯定整明白。好，爷爷冰棍儿老甜，老凉快的冰棍儿，冰棍儿咋卖呀？两块钱一根老凉快了，进价一块卖两块，一天卖一百根挣一百。老板，咱以后天天从您这儿拿货，先压二十，卖完再结账，您不用担风险，每卖一根儿，我分您五毛。行，这买卖我没风险成交。各位老板，以后我提前把冰棍儿送到您摊位上，价钱比夜市便宜。包装上印您店名，您帮我卖每个给您提成，这不错，客人方便，我们也省事儿。哈哈哈经理，我给你们夜市长期供冰棍，价钱比市场低。你先给我订单和预付金，我再采购，先拿订单再采购。好。星仔有头脑，合同签了预付金，打给你统一采购，统一仓储，统一派送，按路线执行。卖不完的转给其他摊位包装上印夜市和商户名，几万个游客，每天看到广告在向商家收推广费。可以呀，小孩哥，我天天守在夜市，扯着嗓子喊一根儿一根的卖。一年下来，我赚了两万多，你赚的是差价。看着像做生意，其实是给自己找了份风吹日晒的苦差事。我找了批发商，先压二十，卖完再结账，又找了夜市，五个摊主帮我卖，每根给他们提成，我没自己守摊，一年赚了五万多。你没拥有所有资源，但你控制并调动了资源，这叫借力赚钱。我先找夜市管理方，拿订单和预付金，再统一采购仓储配送卖不完的，换给其他摊位包装上印夜市和商户名。在说广告前一年赚了八十多万，你控制的不是一批冰棍儿，而是一套，即使你不在也能持续运转的系统。老板短袖多少钱一件？都是今年新款五十九一件。帅哥来一件吗？太贵了，五十九一件儿，没人买你，应该卖一块钱一件儿，你是来找茬的吧，我进货都得十块钱一件儿。别急，我能让你的短袖卖一块钱，不亏钱还能多赚。如果做到了，跟我爸相个亲，行，啥方法买？第一件五十九，第二件三十九，第三件十九，第四件变一块钱四件，成本四十，卖一百一十八挣七十八。我摆了三年地摊，也没想到这法子想卖的更快。花二十八块采购四桶四斤装洗衣液，外面至少三十一桶，买四件短袖就送价值一百二的洗衣液，顾客等于没花钱买了四件短袖，你怎么这么厉害？我爷爷从小就给我看这本书叫做粤商思维。你知道为什么泰国、深圳、香港的首富清一色都是潮汕人吗？背后不是什么神秘力量，而是代代相传的生意思维。你打开看看看这本乐商思维就知道了。你看这一句，您做小老板不打高端工，先落地再做大，很多大生意都是从小生意一点一点积累起来的。再看这一句，没有先天资源就靠敢吃苦，能弯腰。很多人不是输在起点，而是输在不敢开始。还有这句新会陈皮，深耕百年熬出垄断式复利小生意，做久了也能积累出大价值。还有这一句潮商不传，横财，传本事，不传虚名，传基业。真正厉害的人，留下的不只是财富，而是一套创造财富的方法。这本书里面真的是每一句话都在教你如何赚钱，如何做买卖，如何经营人脉，如何拥有老板思维。他把那些祖祖辈辈传下来的生意经掰开了，揉碎了喂到你的面前，帮助我们普通人开悟开窍，完成财富跃迁。但凡你想要改变一下自己当下的状态，打开思维格局，那么这本书真的适合读一读。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 3050,
      "text": "你们三个去老街夜市卖冰棍儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3050,
      "end_ms": 3790,
      "text": "每人一百，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4230,
      "end_ms": 5110,
      "text": "谁赚最多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5270,
      "end_ms": 7430,
      "text": "爷爷答应他一个愿望得嘞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7430,
      "end_ms": 7970,
      "text": "爷爷您瞧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7970,
      "end_ms": 8390,
      "text": "好吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8730,
      "end_ms": 9390,
      "text": "必须的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00008",
      "start_ms": 9450,
      "end_ms": 10470,
      "text": "咱肯定整明白。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00009",
      "start_ms": 10670,
      "end_ms": 10910,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00010",
      "start_ms": 11090,
      "end_ms": 16660,
      "text": "爷爷冰棍儿老甜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16680,
      "end_ms": 17960,
      "text": "老凉快的冰棍儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19420,
      "end_ms": 20480,
      "text": "冰棍儿咋卖呀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21660,
      "end_ms": 23675,
      "text": "两块钱一根老凉快了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00014",
      "start_ms": 26470,
      "end_ms": 27810,
      "text": "进价一块卖两块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28170,
      "end_ms": 29830,
      "text": "一天卖一百根挣一百。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00016",
      "start_ms": 31110,
      "end_ms": 31570,
      "text": "老板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00017",
      "start_ms": 32170,
      "end_ms": 34010,
      "text": "咱以后天天从您这儿拿货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00018",
      "start_ms": 34310,
      "end_ms": 34910,
      "text": "先压二十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00019",
      "start_ms": 34910,
      "end_ms": 35810,
      "text": "卖完再结账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00020",
      "start_ms": 35810,
      "end_ms": 37050,
      "text": "您不用担风险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00021",
      "start_ms": 37050,
      "end_ms": 38530,
      "text": "每卖一根儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00022",
      "start_ms": 38610,
      "end_ms": 39675,
      "text": "我分您五毛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00023",
      "start_ms": 42100,
      "end_ms": 42340,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00024",
      "start_ms": 43180,
      "end_ms": 45020,
      "text": "这买卖我没风险成交。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00025",
      "start_ms": 46940,
      "end_ms": 47660,
      "text": "各位老板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00026",
      "start_ms": 47900,
      "end_ms": 50460,
      "text": "以后我提前把冰棍儿送到您摊位上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50880,
      "end_ms": 52480,
      "text": "价钱比夜市便宜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00028",
      "start_ms": 52780,
      "end_ms": 54160,
      "text": "包装上印您店名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54440,
      "end_ms": 56420,
      "text": "您帮我卖每个给您提成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00030",
      "start_ms": 56920,
      "end_ms": 57500,
      "text": "这不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00031",
      "start_ms": 58240,
      "end_ms": 59120,
      "text": "客人方便，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00032",
      "start_ms": 59380,
      "end_ms": 60435,
      "text": "我们也省事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60800,
      "end_ms": 67215,
      "text": "哈哈哈经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00034",
      "start_ms": 67550,
      "end_ms": 69290,
      "text": "我给你们夜市长期供冰棍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00035",
      "start_ms": 69410,
      "end_ms": 70615,
      "text": "价钱比市场低。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00036",
      "start_ms": 71050,
      "end_ms": 72670,
      "text": "你先给我订单和预付金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00037",
      "start_ms": 72670,
      "end_ms": 73425,
      "text": "我再采购，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74870,
      "end_ms": 76415,
      "text": "先拿订单再采购。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00039",
      "start_ms": 76980,
      "end_ms": 77180,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00040",
      "start_ms": 77180,
      "end_ms": 78245,
      "text": "星仔有头脑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00041",
      "start_ms": 78980,
      "end_ms": 80980,
      "text": "合同签了预付金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00042",
      "start_ms": 80980,
      "end_ms": 84790,
      "text": "打给你统一采购，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00043",
      "start_ms": 84870,
      "end_ms": 85670,
      "text": "统一仓储，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00044",
      "start_ms": 85750,
      "end_ms": 86430,
      "text": "统一派送，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00045",
      "start_ms": 86550,
      "end_ms": 87695,
      "text": "按路线执行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00046",
      "start_ms": 88140,
      "end_ms": 91960,
      "text": "卖不完的转给其他摊位包装上印夜市和商户名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00047",
      "start_ms": 92220,
      "end_ms": 93120,
      "text": "几万个游客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00048",
      "start_ms": 93120,
      "end_ms": 95995,
      "text": "每天看到广告在向商家收推广费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00049",
      "start_ms": 96440,
      "end_ms": 97020,
      "text": "可以呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00050",
      "start_ms": 97020,
      "end_ms": 97685,
      "text": "小孩哥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00051",
      "start_ms": 98120,
      "end_ms": 99280,
      "text": "我天天守在夜市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00052",
      "start_ms": 99400,
      "end_ms": 101465,
      "text": "扯着嗓子喊一根儿一根的卖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00053",
      "start_ms": 101830,
      "end_ms": 102510,
      "text": "一年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00054",
      "start_ms": 102730,
      "end_ms": 103785,
      "text": "我赚了两万多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00055",
      "start_ms": 104760,
      "end_ms": 105935,
      "text": "你赚的是差价。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00056",
      "start_ms": 106750,
      "end_ms": 108005,
      "text": "看着像做生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00057",
      "start_ms": 108550,
      "end_ms": 111655,
      "text": "其实是给自己找了份风吹日晒的苦差事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00058",
      "start_ms": 112050,
      "end_ms": 113030,
      "text": "我找了批发商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00059",
      "start_ms": 113150,
      "end_ms": 113870,
      "text": "先压二十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00060",
      "start_ms": 114010,
      "end_ms": 114810,
      "text": "卖完再结账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00061",
      "start_ms": 114950,
      "end_ms": 115710,
      "text": "又找了夜市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00062",
      "start_ms": 115870,
      "end_ms": 117010,
      "text": "五个摊主帮我卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00063",
      "start_ms": 117110,
      "end_ms": 118150,
      "text": "每根给他们提成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00064",
      "start_ms": 118330,
      "end_ms": 119210,
      "text": "我没自己守摊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00065",
      "start_ms": 119410,
      "end_ms": 120525,
      "text": "一年赚了五万多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00066",
      "start_ms": 120980,
      "end_ms": 122735,
      "text": "你没拥有所有资源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00067",
      "start_ms": 123100,
      "end_ms": 125075,
      "text": "但你控制并调动了资源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00068",
      "start_ms": 125540,
      "end_ms": 126760,
      "text": "这叫借力赚钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00069",
      "start_ms": 127060,
      "end_ms": 128400,
      "text": "我先找夜市管理方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00070",
      "start_ms": 128640,
      "end_ms": 130025,
      "text": "拿订单和预付金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00071",
      "start_ms": 130610,
      "end_ms": 133830,
      "text": "再统一采购仓储配送卖不完的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00072",
      "start_ms": 133870,
      "end_ms": 137635,
      "text": "换给其他摊位包装上印夜市和商户名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00073",
      "start_ms": 137990,
      "end_ms": 140790,
      "text": "在说广告前一年赚了八十多万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00074",
      "start_ms": 141050,
      "end_ms": 143325,
      "text": "你控制的不是一批冰棍儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00075",
      "start_ms": 143740,
      "end_ms": 144460,
      "text": "而是一套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00076",
      "start_ms": 144480,
      "end_ms": 147850,
      "text": "即使你不在也能持续运转的系统。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00077",
      "start_ms": 148110,
      "end_ms": 149695,
      "text": "老板短袖多少钱一件？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00078",
      "start_ms": 150070,
      "end_ms": 151985,
      "text": "都是今年新款五十九一件。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00079",
      "start_ms": 152400,
      "end_ms": 153515,
      "text": "帅哥来一件吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00080",
      "start_ms": 154330,
      "end_ms": 155185,
      "text": "太贵了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00081",
      "start_ms": 155620,
      "end_ms": 156500,
      "text": "五十九一件儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00082",
      "start_ms": 156500,
      "end_ms": 157560,
      "text": "没人买你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00083",
      "start_ms": 157560,
      "end_ms": 158975,
      "text": "应该卖一块钱一件儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00084",
      "start_ms": 159630,
      "end_ms": 160815,
      "text": "你是来找茬的吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00085",
      "start_ms": 161230,
      "end_ms": 162825,
      "text": "我进货都得十块钱一件儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00086",
      "start_ms": 163070,
      "end_ms": 163485,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00087",
      "start_ms": 164090,
      "end_ms": 165690,
      "text": "我能让你的短袖卖一块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00088",
      "start_ms": 165790,
      "end_ms": 166930,
      "text": "不亏钱还能多赚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00089",
      "start_ms": 167170,
      "end_ms": 167930,
      "text": "如果做到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00090",
      "start_ms": 167970,
      "end_ms": 168945,
      "text": "跟我爸相个亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00091",
      "start_ms": 169560,
      "end_ms": 169855,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00092",
      "start_ms": 170280,
      "end_ms": 171350,
      "text": "啥方法买？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00093",
      "start_ms": 171350,
      "end_ms": 172335,
      "text": "第一件五十九，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00094",
      "start_ms": 172640,
      "end_ms": 173620,
      "text": "第二件三十九，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00095",
      "start_ms": 173640,
      "end_ms": 174535,
      "text": "第三件十九，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00096",
      "start_ms": 174760,
      "end_ms": 176580,
      "text": "第四件变一块钱四件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00097",
      "start_ms": 176600,
      "end_ms": 177365,
      "text": "成本四十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00098",
      "start_ms": 177680,
      "end_ms": 179445,
      "text": "卖一百一十八挣七十八。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00099",
      "start_ms": 180920,
      "end_ms": 182160,
      "text": "我摆了三年地摊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00100",
      "start_ms": 182420,
      "end_ms": 184800,
      "text": "也没想到这法子想卖的更快。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00101",
      "start_ms": 185100,
      "end_ms": 188160,
      "text": "花二十八块采购四桶四斤装洗衣液，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00102",
      "start_ms": 188480,
      "end_ms": 189940,
      "text": "外面至少三十一桶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00103",
      "start_ms": 190260,
      "end_ms": 193360,
      "text": "买四件短袖就送价值一百二的洗衣液，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00104",
      "start_ms": 193560,
      "end_ms": 196060,
      "text": "顾客等于没花钱买了四件短袖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00105",
      "start_ms": 196300,
      "end_ms": 197420,
      "text": "你怎么这么厉害？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00106",
      "start_ms": 197620,
      "end_ms": 200840,
      "text": "我爷爷从小就给我看这本书叫做粤商思维。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00107",
      "start_ms": 201200,
      "end_ms": 205260,
      "text": "你知道为什么泰国、深圳、香港的首富清一色都是潮汕人吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00108",
      "start_ms": 205440,
      "end_ms": 207000,
      "text": "背后不是什么神秘力量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00109",
      "start_ms": 207320,
      "end_ms": 209340,
      "text": "而是代代相传的生意思维。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00110",
      "start_ms": 210000,
      "end_ms": 212530,
      "text": "你打开看看看这本乐商思维就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00111",
      "start_ms": 212790,
      "end_ms": 213590,
      "text": "你看这一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00112",
      "start_ms": 213890,
      "end_ms": 215830,
      "text": "您做小老板不打高端工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00113",
      "start_ms": 216010,
      "end_ms": 217210,
      "text": "先落地再做大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00114",
      "start_ms": 217730,
      "end_ms": 221210,
      "text": "很多大生意都是从小生意一点一点积累起来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00115",
      "start_ms": 221890,
      "end_ms": 222710,
      "text": "再看这一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00116",
      "start_ms": 223070,
      "end_ms": 225590,
      "text": "没有先天资源就靠敢吃苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00117",
      "start_ms": 225750,
      "end_ms": 226370,
      "text": "能弯腰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00118",
      "start_ms": 226650,
      "end_ms": 228210,
      "text": "很多人不是输在起点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00119",
      "start_ms": 228330,
      "end_ms": 229710,
      "text": "而是输在不敢开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00120",
      "start_ms": 230010,
      "end_ms": 231590,
      "text": "还有这句新会陈皮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00121",
      "start_ms": 231590,
      "end_ms": 234550,
      "text": "深耕百年熬出垄断式复利小生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00122",
      "start_ms": 234550,
      "end_ms": 236410,
      "text": "做久了也能积累出大价值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00123",
      "start_ms": 236650,
      "end_ms": 238410,
      "text": "还有这一句潮商不传，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00124",
      "start_ms": 238410,
      "end_ms": 238810,
      "text": "横财，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00125",
      "start_ms": 238830,
      "end_ms": 239470,
      "text": "传本事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00126",
      "start_ms": 239550,
      "end_ms": 240150,
      "text": "不传虚名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00127",
      "start_ms": 240150,
      "end_ms": 241035,
      "text": "传基业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00128",
      "start_ms": 241290,
      "end_ms": 242170,
      "text": "真正厉害的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00129",
      "start_ms": 242170,
      "end_ms": 243370,
      "text": "留下的不只是财富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00130",
      "start_ms": 243570,
      "end_ms": 245415,
      "text": "而是一套创造财富的方法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00131",
      "start_ms": 245860,
      "end_ms": 248920,
      "text": "这本书里面真的是每一句话都在教你如何赚钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00132",
      "start_ms": 249000,
      "end_ms": 249845,
      "text": "如何做买卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00133",
      "start_ms": 250160,
      "end_ms": 251120,
      "text": "如何经营人脉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00134",
      "start_ms": 251220,
      "end_ms": 252665,
      "text": "如何拥有老板思维。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00135",
      "start_ms": 253120,
      "end_ms": 256080,
      "text": "他把那些祖祖辈辈传下来的生意经掰开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00136",
      "start_ms": 256080,
      "end_ms": 257560,
      "text": "揉碎了喂到你的面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00137",
      "start_ms": 257740,
      "end_ms": 259520,
      "text": "帮助我们普通人开悟开窍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00138",
      "start_ms": 259680,
      "end_ms": 260835,
      "text": "完成财富跃迁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00139",
      "start_ms": 261210,
      "end_ms": 263470,
      "text": "但凡你想要改变一下自己当下的状态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00140",
      "start_ms": 263630,
      "end_ms": 264705,
      "text": "打开思维格局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_61abd978ec06a646_s00141",
      "start_ms": 265000,
      "end_ms": 266645,
      "text": "那么这本书真的适合读一读。"
    }
  ],
